[7.981953, "o", "All seven commands ran in `/work`. Outputs are below, verbatim.\r\n\r\n**1. `ls -la`**\r\n```\r\ntotal 0\r\ndrwx------ 1 70002 70002  44 Nov  5 15:52 .\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 9     0     0 260 Nov  5 15:52 ..\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 70002 70002  64 Nov  5 15:52 .pytest_cache\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 70002 70002  44 Nov  5 15:52 calc\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 70002 70002  64 Nov  5 15:52 tests\r\n```\r\n\r\n**2. `cat calc/__init__.py`**\r\n```\r\ndef add(a, b, c=0):\r\n    return a + b + c\r\n```\r\n\r\n**3. `grep -rn 'def ' .`**\r\n```\r\ntests/test_calc.py:4:def test_add_positive_numbers():\r\ntests/test_calc.py:8:def test_add_negative_numbers():\r\ntests/test_calc.py:12:def test_add_with_third_argument():\r\ntests/test_calc.py:16:def test_add_third_argument_defaults_to_zero():\r\ncalc/__init__.py:1:def add(a, b, c=0):\r\n```\r\n\r\n**4. `find . -name '*.py'`**\r\n```\r\n./calc/__init__.py\r\n./tests/test_calc.py\r\n```\r\n\r\n**5. `sed -n '1,5p' tests/test_calc.py`**\r\n```\r\nfrom calc import add\r\n\r\n\r\ndef test_add_positive_numbers():\r\n    assert add(2, 3) == 5\r\n```\r\n\r\n**6. `wc -l calc/__init__.py tests/test_calc.py`**\r\n```\r\n  2 calc/__init__.py\r\n 17 tests/test_calc.py\r\n 19 total\r\n```\r\n\r\n**7. `diff calc/__init__.py tests/test_calc.py`**\r\n```\r\n1,2c1,17\r\n< def add(a, b, c=0):\r\n<     return a + b + c\r\n---\r\n> from calc import add\r\n> \r\n> \r\n> def test_add_positive_numbers():\r\n>     assert add(2, 3) == 5\r\n> \r\n> \r\n> def test_add_negative_numbers():\r\n>     assert add(-4, 1) == -3\r\n> \r\n> \r\n> def test_add_with_third_argument():\r\n>     assert add(1, 2, 3) == 6\r\n> \r\n> \r\n> def test_add_third_argument_defaults_to_zero():\r\n>     assert add(1, 2) == add(1, 2, 0) == 3\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe diff is expected: the two files are unrelated. The module defines `add`, and the test file imports it and contains four tests. The repo is not a git repository, and I did not run the tests.\r\n"]
